  triage:title "HTML diagram report not regenerated after .mmd updates" ;
  triage:description "After updating .mmd diagram files, python3 docs/reports/generate_diagram_pages.py was not run and committed. Sprint-U5.md Required Document Updates explicitly requires regenerating diagram pages under docs/atm/ and docs/atm-rusqlite/. The U5 sprint commit (ae75f1a) cut over list and read to SQLite metadata but did not update .mmd files or regenerate the HTML report pages. flow-diagrams.md was last changed in dfe882d (pre-U5); HTML was last regenerated in 335fe3d (U4-merge commit)." ;
